  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Economic Growth and Fiscal Reform Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The program continues efforts of the Asian Development Bank (ADB) to support the Government of Solomon Islands in implementing an ongoing reform program in coordination with other development partners. The proposed program will support continued policy attention to reform, which has become increasingly essential following recent natural disasters, the closure of a large gold mine (an important source of government revenue), and the decline of logging output over the medium term.</narrative>
  </description>
